## Floating feedback widget

The fixed-position upvote prompt that appears in the corner of post pages. Combines an upvote action with a quieter "learn more" link beneath it, so the link reads as a separate action and can't be confused with the upvote click target. The starburst icon is a CSS-only 12-point polygon (no SVG dependency).

Position is `fixed` to the viewport's bottom-right corner, with `env(safe-area-inset-*)` so it respects mobile notch safe areas. Hidden on print via `.kh-u-do-not-print`.

The live page already has one of these in the corner — the markup below is shown as a reference rather than re-rendered.

```html
<div class="kh-floating-thumb kh-u-do-not-print">
