    </span>
  </a>
  <a href="/colophon/#feedback" class="kh-floating-thumb__learn">Why this widget?</a>
</div>
```

Structure: outer wrapper stacks the upvote card on top and the secondary "learn" link below it. Card uses a blue background with a flat sun-yellow bottom rule; the burst sits behind the text using negative-margin overlap inside the action anchor.
